    <briefdescription>
<para>A class representing a table of lists as specified in the DWARF v5 standard for location lists and range lists. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The table consists of a header followed by an array of offsets into a DWARF section, followed by zero or more list entries. The list entries are kept in a map where the keys are the lists&apos; section offsets. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
